Still needs real hardware (2015 MacBook Air + Pixel 6 Pro):
- 10 consecutive launches per target (no WEBGL_UNAVAILABLE / init / timeout flakiness).
- 2-minute p95 frame time <= 16.7ms on minimal meadow (read runtime.frameBudgetVerdict()).
- No long task > 50ms during gameplay (longTaskMonitor snapshot).
- Renderer setup performs no task > 4ms once gameplay begins.
- Cold first visible meadow <= 5s, warm <= 2s; player control latency independent
  of distant-world generation; missing optional assets cannot block movement.
